I'm always open to suggestions, though with a few standard caveats:

1) I don't want this to be PatchHack -- ie. just a compilation of as
many patches that sounded cool as possible.  I'm obviously not averse to
using external patches (Pasi's level compiler and some of his new
levels, Nephi's Gold DSM patch), but overall I do have a fairly strong
sense of the direction I want to go.

2) I (obviously) need to agree that the suggestion/patch matches my idea
of the intended direction.  That doesn't mean suggestions aren't
welcome, but I can't promise to use any of them.

While my primary aim isn't to add lots of new features, eventually the
primary aim (get the balance more, well, balanced, and add some
challenge for experienced players as well as new players) will be
complete or very close to, and at that point I'll have to find a new
primary aim.  New features would probably be it.  ;)

